cities.tsv and admin1.tsv are derived from the GeoNames geographical database.

    https://www.geonames.org/
    Licensed under Creative Commons Attribution 4.0
    https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

Derived by tools/geonames.sh, which names every column it keeps. Nothing is
added; columns are dropped and the coordinates are rounded to four decimal
places.

CC BY 4.0 requires that the credit be given where the work is used, so it is
also in the app's About pane rather than only here.

zone.tab and iso3166.tab are from the IANA tz database and are in the public
domain. They are kept because a timezone is what the app falls back to before a
location has been chosen (D-007), and because they pair a zone with a coordinate
in a way the GeoNames export does not.
